Source: pgcontext
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), cargo, clang, rustc
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/evokoa/pgcontext

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pgcontext
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pgcontext
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: postgresql-PGVERSION-pgvector
Description: hybrid vector and full-text retrieval engine for PostgreSQL
 pgcontext provides dense vector search, metadata-filtered approximate search,
 and hybrid dense plus full-text retrieval inside PostgreSQL. The package also
 includes an optional pgcontext_pgvector compatibility bridge.
